 ire-tickets-1991726744308\n\nHosted by Art Metropole
  (https://artmetropole.com/)\n\nThis public conversation and screening
  brings together Neskantaga First Nation\, Forensic Architecture\, and
  Infrastructure Beyond Extractivism to discuss proposed mining
  infrastructure in Ontario’s Ring of Fire region. Hear how visual
  cultures and spatial research can support Indigenous jurisdiction\,
  challenge state and corporate narratives of “critical mineral”
  development\, and make visible the cumulative impacts of extraction on
  land\, water\, burial sites\, and cultural survivance.
